    { "raw_text": "Spend the year taking risks in hope of getting ahead.\n\nEvents will change your traits, skills, relationships, cash, and starting items depending on your choices.\n\n<b>Cost:</b> 1 year", "seed_translations": { "zh": "用一年的时间冒险一搏，希望借此出人头地。\n\n根据你的选择，事件会改变你的特质、技能、人际关系、现金和开局物品。\n\n<b>耗时：</b> 1 年" } },
    { "raw_text": "Lie low to avoid trouble, and tighten your belt to pocket some cash.\n\n<b>Cost:</b> 1 year", "seed_translations": { "zh": "低调行事以避开麻烦，再勒紧裤腰带攒下一些钱。\n\n<b>耗时：</b> 1 年" } },
    { "raw_text": "Lie low to invest time mastering useful skills or changing personal traits.\n\n<b>Cost:</b> 1-3 years each (Note that aging will impact your traits as well.)", "seed_translations": { "zh": "低调度日，把时间投入到掌握实用技能或改变个人特质上。\n\n<b>耗时：</b> 每项 1-3 年（注意，年龄增长也会影响你的特质。）" } },
    { "raw_text": "Lie low to invest time in changing your personality or physical traits, either adding or removing one trait.\n\n<b>Cost:</b> 1-3 years each (Note that aging will impact your traits as well.)", "seed_translations": { "zh": "低调度日，把时间投入到改变你的性格或身体特质上，可以新增或移除一项特质。\n\n<b>耗时：</b> 每项 1-3 年（注意，年龄增长也会影响你的特质。）" } },
    { "raw_text": "See if any viable ships are available on the market.\n\nSelecting a ship ends career history.\n\n<b>Cost:</b> 1 year", "seed_translations": { "zh": "看看市场上是否有合适的船只可供购买。\n\n选择一艘船会结束职业履历。\n\n<b>耗时：</b> 1 年" } },
